  "comments": "<p>The standard weight was one sixth ounce avoirdupois (72 11/12 grains) although can vary between 4.5-4.9g.<br><br><i>Obverse and reverse die varieties:</i><br><strong>Obverse 1</strong> (1838-49) 'WW' raised on truncation, head and bun further from legend;<br><strong>Obverse 2</strong> (1850-53, 1855) 'WW' raised on truncation, head and bun closer to legend;<br><strong>Obverse 3</strong> (1853, 1855-59) 'WW' incuse on truncation, head and bun closer to legend;<br><strong>Reverse A</strong> (1838-45) Trident shaft touches thigh, straight mouth, plume touches shoulder;<br><strong>Reverse B</strong> (1843-59) Trident shaft short of thigh, down-turned mouth, plume short of shoulder;<br><br><i>1838 reverse die variety:</i><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/60fe64e0f07e4.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/60fe64e0f07e4.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>1839 die varieties:</i><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61bf01c0308c4.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61bf01c0308c4.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>1840 die varieties:</i><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61bf01eab2778.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61bf01eab2778.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>1843 die varieties:</i><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61bf020786b33.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61bf020786b33.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>1844 die varieties:</i><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61bf15bf6c65c.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61bf15bf6c65c.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>1846 die varieties:</i><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61bf15e32bd5c.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61bf15e32bd5c.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>1848 die varieties:</i><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61bf15fe585d2.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61bf15fe585d2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>1850 die varieties:</i><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61bf161519305.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61bf161519305.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>1851 die varieties:</i><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61bf1629df1a0.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61bf1629df1a0.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>1852 die varieties:</i><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61bf163ede60f.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61bf163ede60f.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>1856 die varieties:</i><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61bf165538842.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61bf165538842.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>1857 die varieties:</i><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61bf1669bc598.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61bf1669bc598.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br>For more detailed information on Victorian farthing varieties, please visit <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"http://aboutfarthings.co.uk/catalogue/uk-farthings/victoria-1838-1901\">Aboutfarthings</a>.</p>",
